    <summary>Cross-platform CLI to inspect and free ports used by local processes or Docker.</summary>
    <description>
kport inspects, explains, and safely frees ports. It supports Docker-aware operations,
watch mode, safety shields, JSON output, and an MCP server for AI assistants.

Run `kport mcp` to expose port tools to MCP-compatible clients (VS Code Copilot, Cursor, Claude Desktop).

The Windows installer is downloaded from the official GitHub release during installation.
    </description>
